<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-002" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin076-wangbiaozhi" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-002-jin076-wangbiaozhi">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin076-wangbiaozhi:ninetokens" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin076-wangbiaozhi:ninetokens:m0000" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">温</persName>在姑孰，諷朝廷，求九錫。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin076-wangbiaozhi:ninetokens:m0013" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">謝安</persName>使吏部郎<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin076-wangbiaozhi:ninetokens:m0019" ref="yin_215_w6q">袁宏</persName>具其草，以示僕射<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin076-wangbiaozhi:ninetokens:m0029" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">王彪之</persName>。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin076-wangbiaozhi:ninetokens:m0033" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">彪之</persName>作色曰：『丈夫豈可以此事語人邪？』<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin076-wangbiaozhi:ninetokens:m0052" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">安</persName>徐問其計。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin076-wangbiaozhi:ninetokens:m0058" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">彪之</persName>曰：『聞其疾已篤，且可緩其事。』<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin076-wangbiaozhi:ninetokens:m0076" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">安</persName>從之，故不行。</p>
</text>
